  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NRF2, agricultural school</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NRF2, jordbruksskola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet r&#xf6;r andra fasen av etablerandet av en praktiskt-orienterad jordbruksutbildning p&#xe5; gymnasieniv&#xe5;. Denna fasen kommer att utg&#xf6;ras avutbildningsst&#xf6;d till den nyetablerade skolan. Kompletterande &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder skall milj&#xf6;anpassa verksamheten och utarbeta en ny f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad l&#xe4;roplan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project concerns the second phase of establishing a practical oriented agricultural education on gymnasium level. This phase will concern educational support to the newly established school. The project includes environmental considerations in adjustments to the school buildings and in the school curriculum.</narrative>
  </description>
